                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I reintroduced the ACCESS Act with @RepKatCammack\u2014a commonsense, fiscally responsible plan to expand Health Savings Accounts (HSAs) for millions of lower-income Americans.\n\nThis bill puts patients in control by offering a personal health care option that increases access to affordable treatments, trusted doctors, and essential therapies through tax-free, directly funded health savings accounts. It streamlines existing health subsidies, saving taxpayers tens of billions of dollars.\n\nhttps://t.co/1V6Ph6XpMM",
